    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Īphī^crătes</span></b> ,
			is, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a famous Athenian general</i>, <i><span class="en">Nep. Iph. 1,
			1</span></i> sqq.; <i><span class="en">Just. 6, 5, 2</span></i>.— Hence,
